    tmk:ordinal 8 ;
    tmk:text "a relevant act that is required by this Act to be done within a certain time is not, or cannot be, done within that time, the Registrar may, on application made by the person concerned in accordance with the regulations, extend the time for doing the act." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s224~1" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s224~2> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
