    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) This section applies if a registered trade mark consists of, or contains, a sign that, after the date of registration of the trade mark, becomes generally accepted within the relevant trade as the sign that describes or is the name of an article, substance or service." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s24(1)" .

