    tmk:ordinal 5 ;
    tmk:text "(3) Regulations made for the purposes of paragraph (2)(a) or (b) may make different provision with respect to different components (if any) of the notice of opposition." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s52(3)" .

