    tmk:ordinal 11 ;
    tmk:text "(b) before the notice of opposition is filed, the right or interest on which the person could have relied to file the notice of opposition becomes vested in another person; and" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s52(5)(b)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s52(5)(c)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
