<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s58A(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s58A> ;
