    tmk:ordinal 47 ;
    tmk:text "geographical indication, in relation to goods, means a sign that identifies the goods as originating in a country, or in a region or locality in that country, where a given quality, reputation or other characteristic of the goods is essentially attributable to their geographical origin." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s6/geographical-indication" .

