    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(a) amend the representation of the trade mark as entered in the Register if the amendment does not substantially affect the identity of the trade mark as at the time when the particulars of the application for the registration of the trade mark were published under section 30; or" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s83(1)(a)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s83(1)(b)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
