    tmk:ordinal 26 ;
    tmk:text "(5) If, in a case mentioned in subregulation (1) or (2), the Registrar is satisfied that the applicant, or the applicant and the predecessor in title of the applicant, have continuously used the applicant’s trade mark for a period:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r4.15A(5)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.10(3)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
